  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1 id="page-title">Free DPI Calculator — Calculate Dot Per Inch (PPI) Instantly</h1>
      <p class="lead" id="page-lead">
        A simple, browser-based DPI &amp; PPI calculator. Enter pixel dimensions and physical size to instantly get dot-per-inch density for monitors, prints, and images.
      </p>
      <a class="cta" href="#calculator">Start Calculating</a>
